    "matrix.kitchen.full": {
      "text": "This is my kitchen! I love my kitchen. I open the fridge. Mmm, milk! I close the fridge. The pot is on the stove. The frying pan is hot. Something yummy is in the oven! I look out the window. What a nice day! Now I set the table. I put the placemat on the table. I put the plate on the placemat. Here is my fork, my knife and my spoon. Here is my cup and my bowl. I sit on my chair. Yum, yum, yum! All done! Time to clean up! I clear the table. I scrape my plate into the trash can. I load the dishwasher. I wash the pot in the sink and dry it with the kitchen towel. The cutting board goes back in its place. I wipe the table. I push in my chair. Then I take out the trash. Look! My kitchen is clean. I always clean up after myself.",
